@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* WCAG 1.3.1 / 2.4.1. Every Website Blazor page renders through this layout, so
   wrapping @Body in <main> gives assistive technology a landmark to jump to and
   a stable focus target for a skip-link. The skip-link itself is still deferred
   — the Website has no heavy nav to bypass — but the landmark is not optional
   either way. *@
<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">@Body</main>

<div id="blazor-error-ui" data-nosnippet>
    An unhandled error has occurred.
    @* Same defect as the Control Panel's error bar: href="." resolves to the
       parent directory, so from a nested route the Reload link 404s. Blazor's
       own template uses href="". *@
    <a href="" class="reload">Reload</a>
    <span class="dismiss">🗙</span>
</div>
